  "_doc": "Maps CZ-ISCO / ISCO-08 occupation codes to kp's 16 role_families (data/taxonomy.json::role_families). Used by scripts/build-market-pulse.mjs to roll MPSV vacancy + ISPV wage data up to the taxonomy the app already speaks. Resolution: strip the 'CzIsco/' prefix, take the numeric code, and match the LONGEST key in `byPrefix` that is a prefix of it (e.g. 25121 -> '251' -> software_engineering); fall back to `default`. Keys are ISCO-08 major (1-digit) / sub-major (2) / minor (3) / unit (4) groups. This is a pragmatic best-fit for the Czech labour-market feed, which skews to service/trades/elementary occupations; refine as coverage broadens (e.g. via Jooble).",
